Kumbhakarṇa seeks house against crushing sleep --- Artisans build vast Kailāsa-like palace --- Kumbhakarṇa sleeps for thousands of years --- Rāvaṇa ravages divine gardens and sages --- Kubēra sends envoy urging clan duty --- Envoy tells burnt eye and eight hundred year Śiva friendship --- Envoy warns gods plot killing --- Rāvaṇa slays envoy and marches to conquest
